sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant C as Client
    participant E as ReadingsController<br/>(Api)
    participant S as ReadingService<br/>(Application)
    participant D as MeterReadingsDbContext<br/>(Infrastructure)
    participant Q as SQL Server

    C->>E: POST /api/meters/3/readings
    Note over E: Unreadable JSON or a timestamp with no Z/offset returns 400.<br/>Data annotations reject missing or negative kWh.
    E->>S: AddAsync(meterId, request)
    S->>D: does the meter exist?
    alt meter not found
        S-->>C: NotFoundException → 404
    end
    Note over S: CreatedAt is set from the injected TimeProvider
    S->>D: SaveChangesAsync
    D->>Q: INSERT
    alt unique index violation
        Q-->>D: error 2601 / 2627
        D-->>C: ConflictException → 409
    end
    D-->>S: saved reading
    S-->>E: ReadingResponse
    E-->>C: 201 Created
